      "text": "The slana emits a deafening roar. All creatures within a 100-foot cone take 16d8 sonic damage (DC 44 basic Reflex save saving throw). On a failed save, a creature is also Deafened for 1 minute and Stunned 1 (or deafened permanently and Stunned 3 on a critical failure). The slana can't use Great Roar again for 1d4 rounds."
