      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Thunder Trap",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "A creature hit by the slana's thunderclap attack is Immobilized and held in place by reverberations of sound until it Escapes or Forces Open the bonds of thunder that constrain it (DC 44). The target is Deafened as long as it is immobilized by a thunder trap."
    },
